    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14594" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄπυστος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not heard of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾤχετ᾽ ἄϊστος ἄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					1.242
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Sapph.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				25.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				1.236
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of words,
				<i>inaudible,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄπυστα φωνῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					489
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>without hearing</i> or <i>learning</i> a thing, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲ δὴν ἦεν ἄ. Ζεύς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					5.127
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύθων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					4.675
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακῶν ἔτι πάμπαν ἀπύστω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					14.1389i
				</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				i16
			</span></i>.</div>
